#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Finish the materials-recovery sequence; imports regenerate b451–b470."""
from build_urban import C,U,S,BASE

C(471,'聚合物辨識、清洗收支與熔融造粒品質~Polymer identification, washing balances and pellet quality','environment-recycling',
 ['材質分流~Polymer separation','破碎~Size reduction','摩擦清洗~Friction washing','密度分選~Density separation','乾燥~Drying','熔融過濾與造粒~Melt filtration and pelletizing'],['pet','recycle'],[
 U('進料聚合物收支~Feed polymer balance','先辨識目標聚合物與標籤、金屬、其他樹脂，再將採樣組成換算為產線負荷；混合樹脂可能互不相容。~Identify the target polymer, labels, metals and other resins before converting sampled composition into line loads; mixed resins can be incompatible.','target mass=feed*target fraction;1000*0.75','1000*0.75',750,'kg','代表性混合樣品；假想乾進料~Representative composite sample; hypothetical dry feed','用不同位置的子樣比較目標材質比例。~Compare target fractions in subsamples from different locations.','只採表面大件物會漏掉底部細料及雜質。~Sampling only large surface items misses fines and contaminants underneath.','所有標為塑膠的物件都能直接混合造粒。~All objects labelled plastic can be pelletized together.'),
 U('解離與粒徑分布~Liberation and particle size','破碎須把標籤及附著物解離，過度破碎則增加細粉、清洗損失與能耗。~Shredding liberates labels and attachments, while excessive reduction creates fines, washing loss and energy demand.','fines fraction=mass below screen/feed;35/1000','35/1000',0.035,'fraction','相同乾燥條件下的篩分質量~Sieve masses on the same dry basis','比較刀具間隙改變前後的細粉量與未解離率。~Compare fines and unliberated attachments before/after a cutter-gap change.','只降低平均粒徑可能把可回收樹脂送進污泥。~Reducing mean size alone can send recoverable resin into sludge.','粉碎越細就一定越容易得到最高收率。~Finer grinding always maximizes recovery.'),
 U('表面污染去除~Surface contamination removal','摩擦與液相傳質共同移除表面污染，去除率需以污染物質量計算，不能只看水色。~Friction and liquid-phase mass transfer remove surface contamination; calculate removal by contaminant mass rather than water colour.','removal=(20-3)/20','(20-3)/20',0.85,'fraction','假想可測表面污染，未涵蓋滲入樹脂的物質~Hypothetical measurable surface contamination; absorbed substances excluded','同步量測洗前洗後固體污染及洗液負荷。~Measure solids contamination and wash-liquor load together.','洗液看似透明不代表塑膠內部污染已移除。~Clear wash water does not prove absorbed contaminants were removed.','表面洗乾淨即可證明所有用途都安全。~A clean surface proves suitability for every use.'),
 U('浮沉分選的密度邊界~Density boundaries of sink-float separation','浮沉依表觀密度區分，填料、氣泡與多層片會改變結果；不同聚合物也可能同浮同沉。~Sink-float separation follows apparent density; fillers, bubbles and multilayers alter behaviour and different polymers may share a fraction.','apparent density=mass/volume;0.095/0.0001','0.095/0.0001',950,'kg/m3','獨立假想顆粒；水密度假設1000kg/m3~Isolated hypothetical particle; water assumed1000kg/m3','先去除附著氣泡，再重測同一粒料的浮沉。~Remove adhering bubbles and repeat the same particle test.','把漂浮物全部標成同一樹脂會漏掉材質混入。~Labelling all floating pieces as one resin misses cross-contamination.','密度分選能唯一辨識每一種聚合物。~Density separation uniquely identifies every polymer.'),
 U('循環洗水與排污~Wash-water recycling and purge','循環水可節水但溶解污染累積，穩態下污染輸入需由處理或排污移除。~Recycling saves water but accumulates dissolved contamination; at steady state input must leave through treatment or purge.','steady concentration=load/purge;0.6kg/h/2m3/h','0.6/2',0.3,'kg/m3','完全混合且無其他去除的保守溶質~Well mixed conservative solute with no other removal','增加排污量後預測濃度，並核對總用水。~Predict concentration after a purge increase and check total water use.','無限循環卻忽略污染出口會使收支不閉合。~Unlimited recirculation without a contaminant outlet cannot close the balance.','洗水重複使用不會改變水質。~Reusing wash water leaves its quality unchanged.'),
 U('脫水與乾燥負荷~Dewatering and drying duty','機械脫水先移除自由水，再由熱乾燥處理殘餘水分；只算蒸發潛熱是理論下界。~Mechanical dewatering removes free water before thermal drying; latent heat alone is a theoretical lower bound.','latent duty=water evaporation*latent heat;20kg/h*2257kJ/kg/3600','20*2257/3600',12.5388889,'kW','假想水汽化；未含顯熱與損失~Hypothetical water evaporation; sensible heat and losses excluded','將機械脫水後含水量減半，重算最低熱負荷。~Halve post-dewatering moisture and recalculate minimum thermal duty.','把理論潛熱當成設備額定耗電會漏掉熱損與排氣。~Treating latent heat as rated electricity misses losses and exhaust.','機械脫水與熱乾燥的能量代價完全相同。~Mechanical dewatering and thermal drying have identical energy costs.'),
 U('熔融段物料停留~Material residence in the melt section','熔融段停留時間分布影響混合與熱降解；平均停留時間只是分布的摘要。~Residence-time distribution affects mixing and thermal degradation; its mean is only a summary.','mean residence=hold-up/throughput;12kg/(240kg/h)*60','12/240*60',3,'min','穩態且持料量固定，未描述死角~Steady hold-up; dead zones not represented','以虛擬示蹤脈衝比較平均值與長尾。~Compare mean residence and tailing using a virtual tracer pulse.','長尾使部分樹脂暴露遠久於平均值。~Tailing exposes some resin much longer than the mean.','平均停留3分鐘代表每一顆粒都停留3分鐘。~A3-minute mean means every particle remains3minutes.'),
 U('熔體過濾壓差~Melt-filter pressure drop','過濾攔截固體雜質但不能移除所有溶解污染；壓差隨堵塞與黏度改變。~Melt filters retain solids but cannot remove every dissolved contaminant; pressure drop changes with clogging and viscosity.','relative hydraulic resistance=(Dp2/Q2)/(Dp1/Q1);(6/200)/(4/200)','(6/200)/(4/200)',1.5,'ratio','相同熔體溫度及近似黏度的比較~Comparison at equal melt temperature and similar viscosity','在固定通量比較壓差，另記錄溫度以區分堵塞與黏度變化。~Compare pressure drop at fixed throughput while recording temperature to distinguish clogging from viscosity.','溫度下降造成的黏度升高可能被誤判為濾網堵塞。~Cooling-induced viscosity rise can be mistaken for clogging.','熔體濾網可以完全移除所有化學污染。~A melt screen removes all chemical contamination.'),
 U('粒料品質與批次變異~Pellet quality and batch variation','流動性、尺寸與污染物指標需共同評估；混批可降低波動，也可能掩蓋不合格批次。~Assess flow, dimensions and contaminants together; blending can reduce variation or conceal a rejected batch.','weighted proxy=(100*8+200*11)/300','(100*8+200*11)/300',10,'index units','僅線性品質代理量；熔融流動指數未必線性混合~Linear quality proxy only; melt-flow index need not blend linearly','用實測混合試片檢查線性預測是否成立。~Test blended specimens to check the linear prediction.','把非線性流變指標視為質量加權平均會錯估加工性。~Mass-averaging a nonlinear rheological index mispredicts processability.','混合兩批塑膠後所有物性都是線性平均。~Every property of a polymer blend is a linear average.'),
 U('可售收率與用途界線~Saleable yield and use boundary','全線績效需同時列出合格粒料、排渣、洗水固體和水分；品質用途驗證與質量收率是兩件事。~Report saleable pellets, rejects, wash solids and moisture; fitness-for-use validation differs from mass yield.','saleable yield=600/750','600/750',0.8,'fraction of target feed','分母為目標樹脂乾質量，非總混合垃圾~Denominator is target dry resin, not all mixed waste','追蹤每股去向並比較總進料與目標樹脂兩種收率。~Track all outlets and compare total-feed and target-resin yields.','只報粒料總重可能把殘水與異材質當成回收成果。~Pellet weight alone can count water and other resins as recovered target.','高收率自動代表食品接觸等用途已獲驗證。~High yield automatically validates food-contact and other uses.')])

C(472,'瓶級PET的材質純化、乾燥與去污驗證~Bottle-grade PET purification, drying and decontamination validation','environment-recycling',
 ['瓶源追溯~Bottle-source traceability','整瓶分選~Whole-bottle sorting','洗淨瓶片~Washed flakes','瓶片精選~Flake purification','乾燥與熔融~Drying and melting','去污驗證與批次放行~Decontamination validation and batch release'],['pet','efsa'],[
 U('原料來源與非目標混入~Input provenance and non-target mixing','PET回收需記錄來源、材質及先前用途；看起來像飲料瓶不構成化學來源證據。~Record source, resin and previous use; a bottle-like appearance is not chemical provenance evidence.','non-target fraction=12/1000','12/1000',0.012,'fraction','假想已分類批次，非任何法定允收值~Hypothetical sorted batch; not a legal acceptance criterion','比對進貨紀錄與分層抽樣中的非目標物。~Compare receiving records with non-target items in stratified samples.','只以透明外觀篩選會漏掉同色異材與不同前用途。~Transparency alone misses same-colour foreign resins and previous uses.','透明容器必定是同一品質的PET。~Transparent containers must be equivalent PET.'),
 U('整瓶與瓶片的雙段分選~Whole-bottle and flake sorting','整瓶先移除大部分異材，破碎後再按材質與顏色精選瓶片，兩段的漏選不一定獨立。~Whole-bottle sorting removes bulk foreign material before flake material/colour sorting; misses may be correlated.','independent residual=100*(1-0.9)*(1-0.95)','100*(1-0.9)*(1-0.95)',0.5,'kg','僅假設兩段獨立且同一污染群~Assumes independent stages acting on the same contaminant population','用同一組難辨識異材追蹤兩段漏選是否相關。~Track difficult contaminants through both stages to test correlated misses.','直接相乘名目效率會忽略兩段共同看不見的異材。~Multiplying nominal efficiencies ignores contaminants missed by both.','兩次分選必定提供完全獨立的保護。~Two sorting stages necessarily provide independent protection.'),
 U('瓶蓋與標籤的浮沉去向~Caps, labels and sink-float outlets','PET瓶片與部分瓶蓋材質密度不同可分流，但黏連、氣泡及多層片會讓分離不完全。~Density differences separate PET flakes from some cap resins, but adhesion, bubbles and multilayers prevent perfect separation.','PET recovery=475/500','475/500',0.95,'fraction','已確認進料PET乾質量，假想分離實驗~Known dry PET input in a hypothetical test','分析浮料中的PET損失與沉料中的異材。~Measure PET loss in floats and foreign resin in sinks.','只量沉料總重會把異材重量當PET。~Sink mass alone counts foreign resin as PET.','沉到底部的材料全部都是PET。~Everything that sinks is PET.'),
 U('瓶片污染的ppm基準~Parts-per-million contamination basis','低含量異材用質量比ppm報告；樣本大小與粒子分布決定小樣能否代表整批。~Report trace foreign resin as mass ppm; sample size and particle distribution govern representativeness.','ppm=contaminant/product*1e6;0.015/500*1e6','0.015/500*1e6',30,'mg/kg','假想乾瓶片質量比，非合格門檻~Hypothetical dry-flake mass ratio, not a compliance threshold','將大顆異材集中與均勻分散兩情境比較抽樣結果。~Compare sampling of clustered large fragments and uniformly dispersed contamination.','一小杯未見異材不能證明整噸無異材。~No visible contamination in one small cup does not prove a tonne is clean.','ppm值與採樣代表性無關。~A ppm value is independent of sampling representativeness.'),
 U('含水率與水解風險~Moisture and hydrolysis risk','PET熔融時殘水可促進鏈斷裂；乾燥驗證應測粒料水分而非只記錄乾燥機溫度。~Residual water can promote chain scission during PET melting; verify material moisture rather than dryer temperature alone.','water mass=polymer mass*moisture;500*0.0002','500*0.0002',0.1,'kg water','假想濕度情境，非通用操作規格~Hypothetical moisture scenario, not a universal operating specification','在相同溫度改變停留時間並測材料殘水與黏度。~Change residence time at equal temperature and measure residual water and viscosity.','料層短路可能讓平均乾燥條件掩蓋濕料。~Bed short-circuiting can conceal wet material behind average dryer conditions.','設定乾燥機溫度就等於證明所有瓶片已乾燥。~Setting dryer temperature proves all flakes are dry.'),
 U('鏈長與黏度趨勢~Chain length and viscosity trend','固有黏度可反映分子量趨勢，但需固定溶劑、溫度和方法；不應把任意兩套量測直接比較。~Intrinsic viscosity tracks molecular-weight trends only under consistent solvent, temperature and method.','relative intrinsic-viscosity loss=(0.8-0.72)/0.8','(0.8-0.72)/0.8',0.1,'fraction','相同分析方法的假想IV數據~Hypothetical IV data from the same analytical method','比較相同原料在不同含水率下加工前後IV。~Compare before/after IV for equal feed processed at different moisture levels.','忽略測試條件可能把方法偏差誤認熱降解。~Ignoring test conditions can mistake method bias for thermal degradation.','固有黏度下降10%必定等於分子量下降10%。~A10% IV decrease necessarily equals a10% molecular-weight decrease.'),
 U('去污挑戰試驗的去除率~Removal in a decontamination challenge test','去污試驗以指定替代污染物追蹤處理效果，單一容易去除的物質不能代表全部污染。~Challenge tests track specified surrogate contaminants; one easily removed compound cannot represent all contaminants.','decontamination=1-Cafter/Cbefore;1-0.02/4','1-0.02/4',0.995,'fraction','假想替代污染物；不是核准製程條件~Hypothetical surrogate; not an approved process condition','逐一計算不同替代物的去除並找出限制項。~Calculate removal for each surrogate and identify the limiting case.','只展示最好去除率會隱藏難去除污染。~Reporting only the best removal conceals difficult contaminants.','一項替代物通過即可代表所有化合物都通過。~Passing one surrogate validates every compound.'),
 U('殘餘濃度的最壞情境~Worst-case residual concentration','以明示的初始污染假設乘殘留分率，與適用暴露模型比較；計算本身不構成食品接觸認證。~Multiply a stated input-contamination assumption by the residual fraction and compare with the applicable exposure model; the calculation is not food-contact certification.','residual=Cassumed*(1-removal);3*(1-0.995)','3*(1-0.995)',0.015,'mg/kg','教學初始值；不可取代法規指定情境~Teaching input value, not a regulatory scenario','讓去除率降低一點，觀察殘餘值的倍數變化。~Reduce removal slightly and observe the multiplicative change in residue.','四捨五入成100%去除會錯誤得到零殘餘。~Rounding removal to100% falsely produces zero residue.','99.5%可以當成100%以省略後續計算。~99.5% can be treated as100% to omit further calculation.'),
 U('關鍵條件偏差與批次隔離~Critical-condition deviations and batch segregation','有效去污依賴經驗證的製程條件範圍；偏差時先界定受影響物料與時間，不能靠成品外觀放行。~Effective decontamination relies on validated process conditions; during a deviation identify affected material and time rather than releasing by appearance.','affected mass=throughput*duration;400kg/h*15/60','400*15/60',100,'kg','只計偏差期間進料，另需追蹤設備持料~Feed during deviation only; equipment hold-up also requires tracing','加入設備持料量後擴大追溯範圍。~Add equipment hold-up to widen the traceability boundary.','只隔離警報時刻的一袋會漏掉管線及反應器存料。~Isolating one bag at alarm time misses material in equipment.','成品透明就可忽略去污條件偏差。~Transparent product makes decontamination deviations irrelevant.'),
 U('批次放行與證據鏈~Batch release and evidence chain','來源、分選、含水、製程紀錄與分析報告需對應同一批號；未驗證的用途應保留限制。~Source, sorting, moisture, process records and analyses must map to the same lot; retain restrictions for unvalidated uses.','traceable coverage=complete records/total lots;48/50','48/50',0.96,'fraction','文件完整率不等於安全合格率~Record completeness is not a safety pass rate','找出缺少關鍵紀錄的兩批並保持待審狀態。~Identify the two lots lacking critical records and keep them pending review.','用全廠平均紀錄補填缺失批次會破壞追溯。~Filling missing lot records with plant averages breaks traceability.','文件完整率96%代表所有產品都有96%安全度。~96% record completeness means every product is96% safe.')])

C(473,'輪胎複合材料解離、鋼絲纖維分離與膠粉品管~Tire-composite liberation, steel/fiber separation and rubber quality','environment-recycling',
 ['輪胎接收~Tire receiving','分段剪碎~Staged shredding','鋼絲磁選~Steel magnetic separation','細磨~Fine grinding','纖維風選~Fiber air classification','篩分與膠粉檢驗~Screening and rubber inspection'],['tires','tirerecycle'],[
 U('複合材質清冊~Composite-material inventory','輪胎包含橡膠、鋼材與纖維等組分；用途與輪胎類型使比例改變，不應把整胎重量當膠重。~Tires contain rubber, steel and fiber; proportions vary by tire type and use, so whole-tire mass is not rubber mass.','rubber input=1000*0.65','1000*0.65',650,'kg','假想抽樣組成，不代表所有輪胎~Hypothetical sample composition, not all tires','比較乘用胎與重型胎樣本的材質收支。~Compare material balances for passenger and heavy-duty tire samples.','以固定通用比例結算不同批次可能錯估產率。~A universal fixed composition can misstate yield across batches.','每一種廢輪胎的橡膠比例都相同。~Every scrap tire has the same rubber fraction.'),
 U('粗碎切割與能耗~Primary cutting and energy','粗碎先降低尺寸並暴露鋼絲，能耗取決於進料、刀具狀態與粒徑目標。~Primary shredding reduces size and exposes steel; energy depends on feed, cutter condition and size target.','specific energy=60kWh/2tonne','60/2',30,'kWh/tonne','假想單段電耗，未含後段~Hypothetical single-stage electricity; downstream excluded','在相同進料量比較新舊刀具的電流與粒徑。~Compare current and size distributions for new and worn cutters at equal feed.','刀具鈍化可增加耗能而未提高解離。~Dull cutters can increase energy without better liberation.','耗電越高就表示一定解離得越完全。~Higher electricity necessarily means better liberation.'),
 U('解離程度與金屬回收~Liberation and metal recovery','磁選只容易捕捉已暴露或充分解離的鋼材；橡膠包覆會使混合團塊流向錯誤出口。~Magnetic separation works best on exposed or liberated steel; rubber-coated aggregates can report to the wrong outlet.','steel recovery=180/200','180/200',0.9,'fraction','假想已知鋼材進料~Hypothetical known steel input','量測鋼材出口的附膠與膠料出口的殘鋼。~Measure attached rubber in steel and residual steel in rubber.','只量磁性出口總重會把附膠當鋼材回收。~Total magnetic-product mass counts attached rubber as recovered steel.','磁鐵吸起的所有重量都是純鋼。~Everything lifted by a magnet is pure steel.'),
 U('循環負荷與再磨~Circulating load and regrinding','過大顆粒回到磨機形成循環負荷，設備處理量可遠大於新進料量。~Oversize returns create a circulating load, making mill throughput exceed fresh feed.','mill flow=fresh/(1-return fraction);500/(1-0.25)','500/(1-0.25)',666.666667,'kg/h','每循環固定25%返回，穩態無旁通~Fixed25% return each pass at steady state without bypass','增加篩上返回比例並比較磨機實際負荷。~Increase oversize return and compare actual mill loading.','以新料量選設備會忽略再磨造成的額外負荷。~Sizing equipment from fresh feed ignores recirculating load.','磨機處理量永遠等於新進料量。~Mill throughput always equals fresh feed.'),
 U('環境溫度與低溫破碎比較~Ambient and cryogenic grinding comparison','低溫使橡膠變脆而改變破碎機制，但需另算冷卻來源與能耗；不以實機低溫設定作教學操作。~Cooling embrittles rubber and changes fracture, but cooling supply and energy must be counted separately; no live cryogenic setpoints are prescribed.','sensible cooling=m cp DeltaT;100*1.5*80','100*1.5*80',12000,'kJ','假想定比熱理論量，未含冷媒損失~Hypothetical constant-heat-capacity duty, excluding coolant losses','比較不同初溫下最低冷卻需求與最終粒形。~Compare minimum cooling duty and particle shape at different initial temperatures.','只比較磨機用電會漏算冷卻製備成本。~Mill electricity alone excludes cooling-supply costs.','低溫磨機用電較少就代表整體能源一定較少。~Lower cryogenic mill electricity guarantees lower total energy.'),
 U('纖維風選與終端速度~Fiber air classification and terminal velocity','風選利用形狀、密度與阻力差異；纖維不是球形，球形模型只提供尺度比較。~Air classification uses shape, density and drag differences; fibers are not spheres, so spherical models only compare scales.','Stokes velocity=DeltaRho*g*d^2/(18mu);100*9.81*(0.00005**2)/(18*0.000018)','100*9.81*(0.00005**2)/(18*0.000018)',0.00756944444,'m/s','僅低雷諾數球形假想粒子，不作實機風速建議~Low-Reynolds-number hypothetical sphere only; not a machine airspeed recommendation','對照同質量球粒與纖維的沉降觀察。~Compare settling observations for equal-mass spheres and fibers.','把纖維當成同直徑球會錯估阻力和分選邊界。~Treating fiber as an equal-diameter sphere misestimates drag and separation.','風選只取決於密度而與形狀無關。~Air classification depends only on density, not shape.'),
 U('產品粒徑級配~Product size distribution','不同用途要求不同粒徑與形態；篩分曲線比單一平均粒徑更能顯示過粗與過細尾端。~Applications require different sizes and shapes; a sieve curve reveals coarse and fine tails better than one mean size.','fraction in target band=320/400','320/400',0.8,'fraction','假想乾篩目標區間；不是通用產品規格~Hypothetical dry-sieve target band; not a universal product specification','繪出累積通過曲線並單列兩端質量。~Plot cumulative passing and report both tail masses.','平均尺寸相同的兩批仍可能有完全不同的細粉量。~Two batches with equal mean size may have very different fines.','平均粒徑相同就代表級配相同。~Equal mean particle size means equal gradation.'),
 U('殘留鋼絲與纖維品管~Residual steel and fiber quality control','膠粉中的鋼絲及纖維影響下游加工；代表性採樣與獨立確認比外觀判斷可靠。~Steel and fiber in crumb affect downstream processing; representative sampling and independent checks outperform appearance alone.','steel contamination=0.08/400*1e6','0.08/400*1e6',200,'mg/kg','假想質量檢驗，非安全或產品門檻~Hypothetical mass assay, not a safety or product threshold','比較磁選前後及不同料堆位置的殘鋼。~Compare residual steel before/after magnets and across pile positions.','只檢查表面會漏掉料堆內分層的鋼絲。~Surface inspection misses steel segregated within the pile.','膠粉看起來均勻就不需要雜質分析。~Uniform-looking crumb needs no contamination analysis.'),
 U('除塵質量收支~Dust-capture mass balance','碎磨粉塵須納入物料與暴露控制邊界；集塵量與排放量不同，捕集效率也不等同整套通風有效率。~Include grinding dust in material and exposure-control boundaries; collected mass differs from emissions and collector efficiency differs from whole-system effectiveness.','collector residual=2*(1-0.98)','2*(1-0.98)',0.04,'kg/h','假想進入集塵器的粉塵，不含未被罩口捕集者~Hypothetical dust entering collector; uncaptured hood emissions excluded','另列罩口逃逸量後重算總外逸。~Add hood bypass to recalculate total escape.','只報濾材效率會隱藏罩口漏捕。~Filter efficiency alone hides hood-capture losses.','集塵器98%效率代表現場總粉塵必減少98%。~98% collector efficiency guarantees98% reduction of all site dust.'),
 U('用途驗證與全線收率~Application validation and whole-line yield','橡膠、鋼與纖維需分別追蹤去向，並依目標用途驗證性能與釋出；回收不代表任何場景都適用。~Track rubber, steel and fiber destinations separately and validate performance and release for the intended use; recycled does not mean universally suitable.','rubber yield=520/650','520/650',0.8,'fraction of rubber input','假想回收膠質量，不含鋼材副產物~Hypothetical recovered rubber, excluding steel coproduct','比較回收膠收率、總物料利用率及用途試驗三份證據。~Compare rubber yield, total material utilization and application-test evidence.','把副產鋼加到膠粉收率分子會混淆產品基準。~Adding steel coproduct to rubber yield mixes product bases.','材料被回收後就不需再評估用途與環境條件。~Recycled materials need no further use or environmental assessment.')])

C(474,'拆除前盤點、選擇性拆解與多物料品質追蹤~Pre-demolition inventory, selective dismantling and multi-material traceability','environment-recycling',
 ['材料盤點~Material inventory','受管制材料辨識~Regulated-material identification','選擇性拆解~Selective dismantling','現場分流~On-site segregation','加工分選~Processing and sorting','去向與品質證據~Destination and quality evidence'],['cd','recycle'],[
 U('拆除前材料清冊~Pre-demolition material inventory','先盤點構件、材料、狀況與可再使用性，保留完整構件可能比破碎後回收更有價值。~Inventory components, materials, condition and reusability; retaining components may preserve more value than crushing.','recoverable volume=area*thickness;200*0.15','200*0.15',30,'m3','假想板體幾何量，未扣孔洞與鋼筋~Hypothetical slab geometry, without void/rebar deductions','以圖面估算並用現場量測修正孔洞。~Estimate from drawings and correct openings with field measurements.','圖面與現況不符會使車次與暫存估算失真。~Drawing/site differences distort haul and storage estimates.','建物面積可直接當成拆除廢料體積。~Building area directly equals demolition-waste volume.'),
 U('不確定材料的隔離分類~Segregating uncertain materials','受管制或不明材料需先由合格程序辨識，不可混入普通回收料；教材僅模擬分類與證據管理。~Regulated or uncertain materials need qualified identification before ordinary recycling; this lesson simulates classification and evidence management.','verified coverage=verified locations/required locations;18/24','18/24',0.75,'fraction','紀錄完整率，不代表剩餘材料安全~Record completeness, not safety of remaining materials','把未確認的六處保持待判定並列出所缺證據。~Keep six unverified locations pending and list missing evidence.','用外觀或年齡推論材質會產生錯誤放行。~Inferring material from appearance or age can cause false release.','沒有看到危險標籤就能當一般建材處理。~No hazard label means material can be treated as ordinary construction waste.'),
 U('選擇性拆解順序~Selective dismantling sequence','先保全可再使用構件並分開容易污染的材料，有助降低後續混合；拆解順序需由現場結構計畫決定。~Preserving reusable components and separating contaminating materials reduces later mixing; actual dismantling sequence requires a site structural plan.','reuse fraction=preserved components/identified components;45/60','45/60',0.75,'fraction','假想非結構構件清冊，不提供實體拆除指令~Hypothetical non-structural component inventory; no physical demolition instructions','比較保護包裝前後的完整構件數。~Compare intact component counts with and without protective packaging.','將可用門窗混入破碎流會不可逆地失去完整件價值。~Sending usable doors/windows to crushing irreversibly loses component value.','所有材料都先打碎再分類最能保留價值。~Crushing everything before sorting best preserves value.'),
 U('現場料箱與混入率~On-site bins and contamination rate','清楚標示、物流動線與抽查影響分流品質；混入率以非目標材占產品流質量計算。~Labels, logistics and audits affect segregation quality; contamination is non-target mass divided by product-stream mass.','contamination=0.4/20','0.4/20',0.02,'fraction','假想乾材料質量；同一料箱樣本~Hypothetical dry masses from one bin','比較靠近拆解點與遠端料箱的混入率。~Compare bins close to dismantling points with distant bins.','只增加料箱數而不改善動線可能無法降低混入。~More bins without better logistics may not reduce contamination.','分類標示存在就保證工地沒有混料。~Having labels guarantees no mixing on site.'),
 U('破碎與粒徑分級~Crushing and size classification','破碎解離複合塊，篩分依尺寸分流；石膏、木材等同粒徑材料仍需其他識別方法。~Crushing liberates composite pieces and screening divides sizes; equal-sized gypsum or wood still needs another identification method.','oversize return=feed*oversize fraction;50*0.18','50*0.18',9,'tonne/h','假想篩分物料流；未含再循環增加量~Hypothetical screen flow, excluding recirculation increase','分析每個粒級的材質組成而非只報篩上重量。~Analyze material composition in each size class, not only oversize mass.','把尺寸合格視為材質合格會漏掉同尺寸污染。~Treating correct size as correct material misses same-sized contamination.','一個篩網就能依材質分開所有拆除物。~One screen separates all demolition materials by type.'),
 U('金屬、輕物與礦物分流~Metal, light and mineral streams','磁選、風選與人工或感測分選處理不同性質；各段需追蹤目標回收與伴隨夾帶。~Magnets, air classification and manual/sensor sorting act on different properties; track recovery and entrainment at each stage.','metal purity=4.5/5','4.5/5',0.9,'fraction','假想磁性產品乾質量~Hypothetical dry magnetic-product masses','量測金屬出口夾帶砂漿與礦物出口殘金屬。~Measure mortar entrainment in metal and metal remaining in minerals.','以磁選總重當純金屬會高估回收品質。~Calling all magnetic mass pure metal overstates quality.','磁選回收率高就保證金屬純度高。~High magnetic recovery guarantees high metal purity.'),
 U('石膏與細料交叉污染~Gypsum and fines cross-contamination','石膏與其他細料可污染再生礦物料，需從源頭分流並用適用試驗確認下游用途。~Gypsum and other fines can contaminate recycled minerals; separate at source and verify suitability with applicable tests.','gypsum fraction=0.3/30','0.3/30',0.01,'fraction','假想質量濃度，非任何產品允收上限~Hypothetical mass fraction, not a product acceptance limit','比較源頭分流與混合後分選的殘留量。~Compare residuals from source separation and sorting after mixing.','先混後分可能讓細粉沾附所有顆粒而難以去除。~Mixing first can coat particles with fines that are difficult to remove.','破碎後的細粉都可視為乾淨石粉。~All post-crushing fines can be treated as clean mineral powder.'),
 U('運輸、堆置與實際密度~Transport, stockpiles and bulk density','鬆散料堆有空隙，車載體積與實體密度不可直接互換；重量及體積上限分別檢核。~Loose stockpiles contain voids, so haul volume is not solid-material volume; check mass and volume limits separately.','haul mass=loose volume*bulk density;12*1.4','12*1.4',16.8,'tonne','假想鬆散密度1.4tonne/m3，非車輛載重建議~Hypothetical1.4tonne/m3 bulk density, not vehicle loading advice','以地磅和車斗量測反算不同含水料的鬆散密度。~Infer bulk density from weighbridge and bin measurements at different moisture levels.','使用混凝土實體密度計鬆散料會錯估車次。~Using solid concrete density for loose debris misestimates haul trips.','相同體積的所有拆除料都有相同重量。~All demolition materials of equal volume have equal mass.'),
 U('分流率與用途去向~Diversion rate and destination','分流率需明確定義再使用、回收、暫存與處置，運出工地不代表已完成有效回收。~Define reuse, recycling, storage and disposal explicitly; leaving the site does not prove useful recycling.','verified diversion=(20+65)/100','(20+65)/100',0.85,'fraction','20再使用、65已確認回收；不計未確認暫存~20reused and65verified recycled; unverified storage excluded','把接收證明與實際用途逐批配對。~Match receiving records and actual use by batch.','把暫存當最終回收會重複計算或高估績效。~Counting storage as final recycling can double-count or overstate outcomes.','廢料一旦被載走就等於100%回收。~Waste becomes100% recycled once hauled away.'),
 U('批次品質與數位追溯~Lot quality and digital traceability','材料清冊、分選結果、重量與檢驗需用一致批號串接，為下游使用者保留用途限制。~Link inventory, sorting, weights and tests with consistent lot identifiers and preserve use restrictions for downstream users.','mass closure=outputs-input;20+65+10+5-100','20+65+10+5-100',0,'tonne residual','同一批次、同一含水基準、所有出口皆納入~Same lot/moisture basis with every outlet included','加入一筆重複運單，觀察收支與追溯檢查如何抓錯。~Insert a duplicate haul ticket and observe mass-balance and traceability flags.','不同日期或含水基準混算會製造假的物料損失。~Mixing dates or moisture bases creates false material losses.','重量收支閉合就能證明所有產品品質合格。~A closed mass balance proves all products meet quality requirements.')])

C(475,'再生骨材吸水、級配、污染與混凝土試拌驗證~Recycled-aggregate absorption, gradation, contamination and trial-mix validation','environment-recycling',
 ['母材與來源~Parent material and provenance','破碎解離~Crushing and liberation','篩分分級~Screen classification','含水與吸水試驗~Moisture and absorption tests','配比修正~Mix adjustments','試拌及耐久性驗證~Trial mixes and durability validation'],['rca','rca2022'],[
 U('母材來源與殘留砂漿~Parent material and adhered mortar','再生骨材由原骨材與附著砂漿組成，母材來源與損傷影響吸水及耐久性；不可只看顆粒外觀。~Recycled aggregate combines original aggregate and adhered mortar; source and damage affect absorption and durability, beyond appearance.','mortar fraction=attached mortar/total;180/1000','180/1000',0.18,'fraction','假想材料表徵，不以此單一值判定合格~Hypothetical characterization; no acceptance from this value alone','分別記錄來源路段、母材病害與砂漿比例。~Record source section, parent distress and adhered-mortar fraction separately.','混合未知來源使後續異常無法追溯。~Mixing unknown sources prevents tracing later anomalies.','所有破碎混凝土都能視為相同品質的骨材。~All crushed concrete is equivalent aggregate.'),
 U('級配與累積通過率~Gradation and cumulative passing','級配決定顆粒堆積與漿體需求；必須用整條篩分曲線而非單一最大粒徑。~Gradation affects packing and paste demand; use a full sieve curve rather than maximum size alone.','passing=(total-retained cumulative)/total; (1000-350)/1000','(1000-350)/1000',0.65,'fraction','假想單一篩孔點，完整評估需其他篩孔~Hypothetical single sieve point; full evaluation requires others','將一段粒級不足的樣本與連續級配比較空隙量。~Compare voids in a gap-graded sample and continuous gradation.','相同最大粒徑也可能具有不同漿體需求。~Equal maximum size can still produce different paste demands.','最大粒徑相同就代表配比可完全不變。~Equal maximum size means the mixture needs no adjustment.'),
 U('烘乾與飽和面乾吸水率~Oven-dry and SSD absorption','吸水率以飽和面乾與烘乾質量差除烘乾質量；表面水未擦除會使吸水值偏高。~Absorption uses SSD minus oven-dry mass over oven-dry mass; unremoved surface water biases it high.','absorption=(Mssd-Mod)/Mod;(1060-1000)/1000','(1060-1000)/1000',0.06,'fraction','同一樣本與明示試驗程序，假想數據~Same sample under a specified test method; hypothetical data','比較正確面乾與表面仍有水膜的稱量結果。~Compare correct SSD weighing with a remaining surface-water film.','面乾判定不一致會污染配比水修正。~Inconsistent SSD determination corrupts batch-water correction.','6%吸水率是以飽和面乾質量作分母。~6% absorption uses SSD mass as its denominator.'),
 U('實際含水率與自由水~Actual moisture and free water','實際含水率高於吸水率時帶入自由水；低於吸水率時可能吸收拌合水，速率還受時間影響。~Moisture above absorption adds free water; below absorption can absorb mixing water, with time-dependent kinetics.','free water=Mod*(moisture-absorption);1000*(0.08-0.06)','1000*(0.08-0.06)',20,'kg','以烘乾質量為基準，假設達到所用吸水平衡~Oven-dry basis assuming the stated absorption equilibrium','將實際含水率改成4%，解釋負自由水的意義。~Change actual moisture to4% and explain negative free water.','把總含水都當自由水會少加必要拌合水。~Treating total moisture as free water under-adds mixing water.','骨材含水率8%表示全部8%都可供水泥使用。~8% aggregate moisture means all8% is available to cement.'),
 U('體積置換與密度差~Volume replacement and density difference','再生與天然骨材密度不同時，等質量替換會改變絕對體積與產量；應說明置換基準。~When recycled and natural aggregate densities differ, equal-mass replacement changes absolute volume and yield; state the replacement basis.','mass for volume=rho*V;2300*0.4','2300*0.4',920,'kg','假想顆粒體積0.4m3與密度2300kg/m3~Hypothetical0.4m3 particle volume and2300kg/m3 density','比較以質量與體積各置換同一比例的產量。~Compare yield for equal replacement percentages by mass and volume.','未說明質量或體積比例會讓兩組試拌不可比較。~Unstated mass/volume replacement makes trial mixes incomparable.','置換30%永遠只有一種明確定義。~30% replacement has only one possible definition.'),
 U('污染物與用途限制~Contaminants and use restrictions','木材、石膏、瀝青、氯化物等需依用途分析；總雜質量相同不代表影響相同。~Analyze wood, gypsum, asphalt, chlorides and other contaminants for the intended use; equal total contamination does not mean equal effects.','contaminant fraction=2.5/1000','2.5/1000',0.0025,'fraction','假想質量試驗；非通用允收上限~Hypothetical mass test; not a universal acceptance limit','把相同總量分成不同污染種類，列出所需追加試驗。~Split equal total contamination into different types and list additional tests needed.','只報總雜質會掩蓋少量但重要的特定污染。~Total impurity alone hides small but important specific contaminants.','總雜質低就能省略所有化學檢驗。~Low total impurity eliminates all chemical testing.'),
 U('有效水膠比修正~Effective water-to-binder correction','有效水量含外加水與自由水並扣除適用時間內的吸水；比值需與工作性、強度一起驗證。~Effective water includes added/free water minus absorption within the relevant time; validate the ratio with workability and strength.','effective w/b=(added+free)/binder;(160+20)/400','(160+20)/400',0.45,'ratio','已另滿足骨材吸水且無其他水來源~Aggregate absorption already satisfied; no other water sources','改變自由水但保持目標水膠比，重算需加水量。~Change free water at fixed target ratio and recalculate added water.','現場追求坍度隨意加水會改變有效水膠比。~Adding water solely to chase slump changes effective ratio.','骨材吸水率提高時只要無限加水即可保持所有性能。~Unlimited extra water preserves every property when aggregate absorption rises.'),
 U('試拌強度的平均與變異~Trial-mix strength mean and variability','試體強度須用一致製作、養護與試驗程序，平均值與離散程度共同評估。~Use consistent casting, curing and testing; assess both mean strength and variability.','mean=(32+35+38)/3','(32+35+38)/3',35,'MPa','假想同齡期三試體，非結構設計或驗收強度~Hypothetical same-age specimens; not design or acceptance strength','新增一個偏低試體後檢查平均、離散與製作紀錄。~Add a low result and inspect mean, spread and specimen records.','只報最高值會掩蓋品質不穩。~Reporting only the maximum hides unstable quality.','一顆試體達到目標就證明整批都達標。~One target-strength specimen proves the whole lot passes.'),
 U('收縮、耐久性與時間尺度~Shrinkage, durability and time scale','附著砂漿可能改變收縮與輸送性，短期強度不足以代表長期耐久；試驗要符合預定暴露。~Adhered mortar can alter shrinkage and transport; short-term strength does not represent long-term durability, so tests must match exposure.','strain=length change/original;0.3/500','0.3/500',0.0006,'strain','假想長度變化0.3mm、標距500mm；溫度效應另計~Hypothetical0.3mm change over500mm; thermal effects separate','比較相同養護下天然與再生骨材試體的時間曲線。~Compare time curves for natural and recycled aggregate under equal curing.','未控制溫濕度會把環境差異誤當材料效應。~Uncontrolled temperature/humidity confounds material effects.','28天強度相同就代表所有長期耐久性相同。~Equal28-day strength implies identical long-term durability.'),
 U('批次放行與持續品管~Lot release and ongoing quality control','來源、級配、含水、污染及試拌結果需串接；品質改變時重新評估配比而非沿用舊值。~Link provenance, gradation, moisture, contamination and trials; reassess mixtures when quality changes rather than reusing old values.','absorption shift=new-old;0.075-0.06','0.075-0.06',0.015,'fraction points','假想批次吸水率改變1.5個百分點~Hypothetical lot absorption change of1.5percentage points','用新吸水率重算水修正並觸發一次試拌檢查。~Recalculate water correction with new absorption and trigger a trial-mix check.','舊含水修正套用新料批會讓有效水量逐批漂移。~Old moisture corrections on new lots create drifting effective water.','首次試拌合格後就不需要再檢查骨材批次。~After one successful trial mix, later aggregate lots need no checks.')])
